    "j_invariant_reasoning": "for y^2 = x^3 + a(t)x + b(t) the fibre j-invariant is 1728 * 4a^3 / (4a^3 + 27b^2); the frozen family has a(t) = 0 identically, so j = 0 for every fibre and every member of the family",
